each file lands in your folder under its name, and its `fetched:` line names its /cdn/ address, the one the world uses. With no `fetched:` line below, `spawn tripo status 3cfa6f0b-ba20-4b5f-9185-3a08bf3967ed --out fire_axe.glb` lands them.
facing: a workshop file, so it faces the way its bytes do: Tripo puts the side that fire_axe.generated_image_url.jpeg shows on +X. Set model.forward to where the subject faces there: toward you "+x", away "-x", to the picture's left "+z", to its right no forward.
