origin: the engine stands this model with its lowest point on the object's feetPosition. Its lowest point is 0.250 m under the file's origin at the file's own size, so the origin draws 0.250 m straight above the feetPosition, the point the object turns about by default. model.offset: [0, -0.25, 0] draws the origin on the feetPosition.
